1
00:00:00,225 --> 00:00:02,125
(Raj:)I don't understand.

2
00:00:02,127 --> 00:00:05,997
(Howard:)The three of us
aren't having this baby.

3
00:00:06,698 --> 00:00:08,698
(Howard:)Just the two of us.

4
00:00:08,700 --> 00:00:11,200
(Sheldon:)Oh...

5
00:00:12,204 --> 00:00:14,404
(Howard:)Okay. Yeah, I get it.

6
00:00:15,474 --> 00:00:16,804
(Howard:)I'll back off.

7
00:00:16,808 --> 00:00:18,538
(Howard:)Thanks for understanding.

8
00:00:18,543 --> 00:00:19,573
(Bernadette:)Of course.

9
00:00:19,578 --> 00:00:22,878
(Raj:)I'll give you guys some space.

10
00:00:24,816 --> 00:00:26,486
(Raj:)Let me just get this
out of your way.

11
00:00:34,926 --> 00:00:35,926
(Howard:)You need some help?

12
00:00:35,927 --> 00:00:38,497
(Raj:)No, I got it.

13
00:00:43,335 --> 00:00:45,205
(clattering)

14
00:00:45,203 --> 00:00:46,073
(grunts)

15
00:00:46,071 --> 00:00:47,101
(Bernadette:)Raj... Raj, wait.

16
00:00:47,105 --> 00:00:49,335
(Raj:)Please, Bernadette.

17
00:00:49,341 --> 00:00:52,341
(Raj:)Let me leave with my dignity.

18
00:00:58,950 --> 00:01:03,020
(thumps)

